'''Chambers of Xeric: CM (5-Scale) Speed-Chaser''' is a [[Combat Achievements/Master|master combat achievement]] which requires the player to complete a [[Chambers of Xeric/Challenge Mode|Chambers of Xeric: Challenge Mode]] (5-scale) in under 30:00.

Like other tasks requiring a specific number of players, this combat achievement is not required for [[Group Ironman Mode|Group Ironmen]] with a smaller group size.

